WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.380
A man of 75 is told to leave his country,

2
00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:06.370
his relatives and his father's house.

3
00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.700
He is not even told where he is going.

4
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:12.030
Only: to the land that God will show him.

5
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.290
He goes.

6
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.720
Jews still call him Abraham our father.

7
00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:22.030
So why does a promise made to this
one man still shape Jewish life today?

8
00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:26.400
In this mission, you'll read the
promises God made to Abraham in Genesis,

9
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.590
and the sign that went with them.

10
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:33.060
Then you'll follow the promised land through
the long history of the Jewish people.

11
00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:38.770
Your mission: find out why God's promise
to Abraham still shapes Jewish life today.
